  },
  {
    "start": 1020.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "而是來自你們的堅定和實力",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1024.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "副總統蕭美琴出席授旗儀式",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1026.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "還致贈20萬加財金",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1028.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "鼓勵選手們勇敢追夢",
