  },
  {
    "start": 1063.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "不過這一屆陣容出現大幅變動",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1067.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "曾經和林佳葷搭檔",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1069.2,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "締造女雙二聯霸的老將何秋美退役",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1074.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而兩位從2013年聽奧",
