  },
  {
    "start": 1102.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "雖然這次無緣再與何秋美搭檔",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1104.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "挑戰女雙三聯霸",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1106.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但仍展現其獨心",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1108.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "要在網球女單與混雙項目一拼獎牌",
