  },
  {
    "start": 1116.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "所以我覺得特別加強是經驗",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1119.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "還有秋天啥的變化",
