  },
  {
    "start": 1140.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這次不只打混雙",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1142.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "還要挑戰男單與男雙",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1144.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "體力成為最大考驗",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1146.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因為屁屁年紀到了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1148.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "年紀非常大",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1150.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "所以不能體能練太多",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1152.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不然有時候怕容易抽傷",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1154.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "所以變成打球的成分會多一點點",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1157.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "這次她將與新秀周少羽搭檔出戰男雙",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1160.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "王俊偉認為",
