  },
  {
    "start": 1221.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "也針對幾個競敵國家的打法進行研究",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1224.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "教練表示這屆每個項目",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1226.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "都有奪牌機會",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1228.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但不會給選手太大壓力",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1230.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "重點是發揮出實力",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1232.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "把每一場比賽打好",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1234.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "公視新聞 牛軒文 吳嘉寶 台南報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1238.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "羽球一直是台灣代表隊的",
