    "start": 1279.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "混雙平常就有培養 像彥如是配忠義",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1283.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "所以他們兩組我們有針對像學校",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1285.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "有代表隊的培練員 然後陪他們訓練",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1287.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "所以在默契上應該沒有什麼太大的問題",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1290.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "另外陳鼎跟榮玉他們這次也剛才剛開始恢復",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1294.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "鄭成鼎與范榮玉曾在全國身心障礙賽搭配奪金",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1298.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "培養出良好默契",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1300.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因此教練團決定更換混雙搭檔",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1302.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "希望提升奪牌機率",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1304.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "在日本面研究所的老將范榮玉",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1307.2,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "10月底才回國",
