  },
  {
    "start": 1315.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "相對來講還是多多少少還是會擔心",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1319.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "自己的功課 自己的研究 然後論文",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1323.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "會沒有辦法跟上進度",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1325.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而上屆女雙銀牌的搭檔陳彥如",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1328.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也表示默契仍需加強",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1330.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "專打的默契這樣還沒有很合",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1334.2,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "所以我們這些訓練的時候",
