  },
  {
    "start": 1345.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "那誰誰來打會比較好",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1348.2,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "單打部分世界聽障男單排名第三的鄭成鼎",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1351.2,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "勵志這次要奪牌",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
